 5pi/3; otherwise all three would be less than pi/3 and could not sum to 2pi. Thus one unique start precedes the short containing arc. For each of three starts the other two independent points lie in the next one-sixth circle with probability 1/36. The cases are disjoint.","status":"matches"},"assessed":false,"bank":"amc","canonicalNodeIds":["cnm_h141"],"coverage":"aligned_concept_only","flags":["The result assumes independent uniform choices with respect to arc length; coincident points and boundary cases have probability zero.","Independent uniform sampling with respect to arc length is assumed; independence alone does not specify the sampling distribution.","Coincidences and exact 60° boundary separations have probability zero under uniform sampling."],"questionId":"2003_AMC_12B_Q25","reviewStatus":"machine_adjudicated","routes":[{"contextNodeIds":["cnm_250","cnm_h057","cnm_h059","cnm_h060"],"id":"unique-short-arc-start","label":"Count the three possible starts of the short containing arc","methodDirectNodeIds":{"unique-short-arc-start":["math:geometric-probability","cnm_137","cnm_276","cnm_277","cnm_h067","cnm_h141","cnm_h138"]},"nodeIds":["math:geometric-probability","cnm_137","cnm_276","cnm_277","cnm_h067","cnm_h141","cnm_h138","cnm_250","cnm_h057","cnm_h059","cnm_h060"]}]}],"canonicalNodeIds":["cnm_h141"],"label":"独立事件的概率计算","layer":"CN","meaning":"Practice covers aligned canonical concepts, with no claim of complete standard coverage or mastery.","nextOffset":null,"sourceNode":{"criteria":["能计算 n 次独立都发生的概率","能用对立事件求至少一次"],"description":"会计算多次独立重复中「都发生」或「至少一次」的概率。条件概率不在必修范围。","id":"cnm_h141","label":"独立事件的概率计算","original":{"chapter":"高二 第十章 概率 10.2","description":"会计算多次独立重复中「都发生」或「至少一次」的概率。条件概率不在必修范围。","domain":"统计与概率","external":false,"grade":11,"id":"cnm_h141","mastery_criteria":["能计算 n 次独立都发生的概率","能用对立事件求至少一次"],"name":"独立事件的概率计算","semester":"上","standards":[{"confidence":"inferred","id":"cms-2017:H.PS.07","note":"计算是独立性定义的应用。不引入条件概率。待核。"}],"type":"procedur